   "lines": [
    {
     "bbox": [
      52.8,
      62.88,
      288.96,
      71.76
     ],
     "text": "surface of \u2018Golden Friendship\u2019 (Hartellody) leaves is glossy,"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      52.56,
      72.96,
      258.72,
      82.08
     ],
     "text": "whereas \u2018Sun King\u2019 and \u2018Pierre B\u2019 have dull leaves."
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      53.28,
      82.56,
      290.16,
      91.92
     ],
     "text": "\u2018Golden Friendship\u2019 (Hartellody) has weak sepal extensions"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      52.8,
      91.92,
      285.12,
      100.56
     ],
     "text": "while those of \u2018Pierre B\u2019 are moderate. The seed vessel of"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      53.52,
      101.76,
      264.48,
      111.36
     ],
     "text": "\u2018Golden Friendship\u2019 (Hartellody) is larger than that of"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      53.28,
      112.08,
      268.08,
      121.2
     ],
     "text": "\u2018Pierre B\u2019. \u2018Golden Friendship\u2019 (Hartel}ody) has yellow"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      53.28,
      121.68,
      280.8,
      131.04
     ],
     "text": "stamen filaments, while those of \u2018Sun King\u2019 are red, and"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      53.04,
      131.76,
      264.96,
      140.88
     ],
     "text": "those of \u2018Pierre B\u2019 are orange. In \u2018Golden Friendship\u2019"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      53.04,
      141.84,
      277.68,
      151.2
     ],
     "text": "(Hartellody) the stigma is above the anthers, whereas in"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      53.52,
      151.68,
      291.36,
      161.76
     ],
     "text": "\u2018Sun King\u2019 and \u2018Pierre B\u2019 it is below the anthers. The petals"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      53.04,
      162.24,
      270.0,
      171.12
     ],
     "text": "of \u2018Golden Friendship\u2019 (Hartellody) have no basal spot,"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      53.04,
      171.84,
      281.04,
      181.2
     ],
     "text": "whereas there is a basal spot on the petals of \u2018Sun King\u2019"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      53.52,
      182.16,
      282.0,
      190.8
     ],
     "text": "and \u2018Pierre B\u2019. \u2018Golden Friendship\u2019 (Hartellody) petals are"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      53.76,
      192.24,
      252.0,
      199.92
     ],
     "text": "reflexed while those of \u2018Pierre B\u2019 are not. \u2018Golden"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      53.76,
      201.84,
      284.4,
      210.96
     ],
     "text": "Friendship\u2019 (Hartellody) flowers in mid season; \u2018Sun King\u2019"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      53.76,
      212.16,
      173.28,
      220.8
     ],
     "text": "and \u2018Pierre B\u2019 in early season."
    }
   ],
   "page": 1,
   "score": 0.9595,
   "signal": "pp-doclayoutv3",
   "source": "tesseract-psm3",
   "text": "surface of \u2018Golden Friendship\u2019 (Hartellody) leaves is glossy,\nwhereas \u2018Sun King\u2019 and \u2018Pierre B\u2019 have dull leaves.\n\u2018Golden Friendship\u2019 (Hartellody) has weak sepal extensions\nwhile those of \u2018Pierre B\u2019 are moderate. The seed vessel of\n\u2018Golden Friendship\u2019 (Hartellody) is larger than that of\n\u2018Pierre B\u2019. \u2018Golden Friendship\u2019 (Hartel}ody) has yellow\nstamen filaments, while those of \u2018Sun King\u2019 are red, and\nthose of \u2018Pierre B\u2019 are orange. In \u2018Golden Friendship\u2019\n(Hartellody) the stigma is above the anthers, whereas in\n\u2018Sun King\u2019 and \u2018Pierre B\u2019 it is below the anthers. The petals\nof \u2018Golden Friendship\u2019 (Hartellody) have no basal spot,\nwhereas there is a basal spot on the petals of \u2018Sun King\u2019\nand \u2018Pierre B\u2019. \u2018Golden Friendship\u2019 (Hartellody) petals are\nreflexed while those of \u2018Pierre B\u2019 are not. \u2018Golden\nFriendship\u2019 (Hartellody) flowers in mid season; \u2018Sun King\u2019\nand \u2018Pierre B\u2019 in early season.",
   "text_format": "plain",
   "type": "text"
  },
