      562.8
     ],
     "text": "\u2018Pearl Buttons\u2019 is of medium height. The plants have a"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      320.16,
      564.24,
      528.0,
      572.64
     ],
     "text": "higher density of foliage and flowers, thicker stems,"
