    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      319.92,
      584.16,
      553.92,
      592.8
     ],
     "text": "than \u2018White Spring\u2019. The floral tubes of \u2018Pearl Buttons\u2019 are"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      320.16,
      594.24,
      530.88,
      602.64
     ],
     "text": "red-orange in older flowers whereas those of \u2018White"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      319.92,
      604.32,
      554.88,
      612.96
     ],
     "text": "Spring\u2019 are yellow\u2014 green. The style plus stigma length is"
